// Hand-maintained list of deleted/non-theatrical scenes in the screenplay corpus.
//
// These scenes exist in our screenplay sources but were NOT in the theatrical
// release. They are tagged (not dropped) so they remain available as trivia
// material, but are excluded from FP and CIDS scoring.
//
// HOW TO ADD AN ENTRY:
//   1. Find the scene in output/corpus/<character>/screenplays/scenes.json
//   2. Note the "source" (e.g. "7_deathly_hallows_p1") and "scene_index"
//   3. Add an entry below with the film, scene_index, affected characters,
//      reason, and optionally a text_snippet for human verification.
//
// Fields:
//   film          - matches the "source" field in corpus scenes.json
//   scene_index   - integer index within that film's parsed scenes
//   characters    - list of canonical character names affected
//   reason        - one of: "deleted_scene", "extended_edition", "draft_only"
//   note          - free-text explanation for the client
//   text_snippet  - (optional) a short snippet from dialogue/directions to help
//                   verify the match is correct when reviewing
{
  "entries": [
    {
